OL,3,GNEWSAPerson dies after being hit by
OL,4,Atrain near Ely
OL,5,
OL,6,FA person has died after being hit by a
OL,7,Ftrain in Cambridgeshire.
OL,9,FBritish Transport Police said officers
OL,10,Fand paramedics were called to the
OL,11,Frailway line near Ely at 11:16 BST on
OL,12,FFriday and that the casualty was
OL,13,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,15,FThe force said inquiries into the
OL,16,Fcircumstances leading up to the death
OL,17,Fwere ongoing.
OL,19,FNational Rail said "major disruption"
OL,20,Fwas expected on several lines until
OL,21,F18:00.
